  "body": "RFC 2617 is now obsolete and has been replaced by four documents (see https://lists.w3.org/Archives/Public/ietf-http-wg/2015OctDec/0011.html for details).\n\nIn the context of FETCH, updating the reference to refer to RFC 7235 is probably sufficient (unless something specific to Basic or Digest is needed).\n",
